Package: unibucbeamer
Title: University of Bucharest Beamer Template for R Markdown
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("George", "Gunnesch-Luca", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "george.gunnesch-luca@unibuc.ro"),
    person("Adobe", role = "cph",
           comment = "Source Sans 3 font, SIL Open Font License 1.1")
  )
Description: An R Markdown template for Beamer presentations in the
    University of Bucharest colours, in Romanian and English. Based on the
    CambridgeUS theme, with a title page, logo, and a pandoc Lua filter for
    sub-headings and blocks.
URL: https://github.com/GGLuca/unibuc-beamer-template
BugReports: https://github.com/GGLuca/unibuc-beamer-template/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for the bundled font (Adobe, SIL Open
    Font License 1.1) and the University of Bucharest logo and artwork.
Imports: rmarkdown
SystemRequirements: XeLaTeX (e.g., via tinytex::install_tinytex())
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
